    kind: invariant  # 1402
    title: "Invariants should never have status 'done' — need a 'holding'/'enforced' status"  # 1402
    status: needs_human_review  # 1402
    priority: 1  # 1402
    parent:  # 1402
    tags: []  # 1402
    before: []  # 1402
    duplicate_of: []  # 1402
    not_duplicate_of: []  # 1402
    pr_ref:  # 1402
    justification:  # 1402
    description: "Invariants represent perpetual truths about the system, not tasks to complete. Currently many INV-* and META-* items are marked 'done', which implies they can be forgotten. Need a new status (e.g. 'holding' or 'enforced') for invariants that are currently satisfied. Work items that fix violations get 'done'; the invariant itself stays 'holding'. This is a governance/schema change that requires human decision."  # 1402
    fields:  # 1402
      statement: "Invariants represent perpetual system truths and must never be marked done"  # 1402
      root_cause: "Tracker schema has no holding/enforced status for invariants, so done is used as a catch-all"  # 1402
